Each piece of Content may be subject to its own license terms as specified
by its author. In the absence of explicit licensing by the author, Content
should be considered "All Rights Reserved" by the original creator.

Contributors to this repository:
- Retain full ownership and copyright of their submitted Content
- Grant permission for their Content to be distributed via this repository
- May withdraw their Content at any time by submitting a pull request

Users of this repository:
- Must respect the rights of individual Content creators
- Should contact Content authors directly for licensing questions
- May not redistribute Content outside the terms specified by its author

For questions about Content licensing, please contact the original author
as indicated in the Content's metadata or creator notes.

